RECITALS

WHEREAS, Landlord and Tenant (or their predecessors-in-interest) are parties to that certain [Lease/Lease Agreement] dated as of [date] (the "Original Lease"), together with that certain [Commencement Date Memorandum/other document] dated [date] (the "Commencement Agreement"), and as further amended by that certain [First] Amendment to Lease dated [date] (the "[First] Amendment") (the Original Lease, the Commencement Agreement, the [First] Amendment, and any other document amending, supplementing, or memorializing the terms thereof, collectively, the "Existing Lease"), pursuant to which Landlord leases to Tenant, and Tenant leases from Landlord, the premises described therein (the "Premises"), located at [address/legal description], as more particularly described in the Existing Lease;

WHEREAS, the parties to this instrument are [Landlord Legal Name], a [entity type] organized under the laws of [jurisdiction] ("Landlord"), acting by and through its duly authorized [officer/attorney-in-fact], [name/title], whose authority to act on Landlord's behalf remains in full force and has not been revoked, modified, or limited, and [Tenant Legal Name], a [entity type] organized under the laws of [jurisdiction] ("Tenant"), acting by and through its duly authorized [officer/representative], [name/title] (Landlord and Tenant, together, the "Parties");

WHEREAS, this [Amendment/Renewal/Agreement] is made and entered into as of [single, unambiguous date] (the "Effective Date"), which date is consistent throughout this instrument and all exhibits, schedules, and signature pages hereto; and

WHEREAS, the Parties now desire to [amend/renew/extend] the Existing Lease on the terms set forth below;

NOW, THEREFORE, in consideration of the mutual covenants contained herein and other good and valuable consideration, the receipt and sufficiency of which are hereby acknowledged, the Parties agree as follows: [operative provisions follow].
